# ============================================================================
# END OF .gitignore
# ============================================================================
# Summary of excluded patterns:
# - All data directories (~22GB)
# - All Python caches (1600+ dirs)
# - All virtual environments (7+ dirs)
# - All logs and test outputs
# - All IDE configurations
# - All OS-generated files
# - All secrets and credentials
# - All build artifacts
# - All temporary files
#
# KEPT for version control:
# - All source code (*.py, *.js, etc.)
# - Configuration templates
# - Documentation (*.md)
# - Requirements files
# - Docker configurations
# - Test files (not test data)
# - Scripts
# ============================================================================
